WEBVTT

00:09:27.197 --> 00:09:32.049
What can we do in order for us 
to provide opportunities for each one

00:09:32.049 --> 00:09:35.209
of the students to learn at his own pace

00:09:35.209 --> 00:09:39.239
rather than being part 
of only the class at large?

00:09:39.886 --> 00:09:44.056
There is a lot, I think, 
that needs to be looked at.

00:09:44.056 --> 00:09:46.893
But one thing that I am sure about

00:09:46.893 --> 00:09:52.142
is we did not yet reach
the end of that question in one end,

00:09:52.142 --> 00:09:55.678
and the second is
that, no matter what we will do,

00:09:55.678 --> 00:09:59.100
part of that education equation
has to always be

00:09:59.100 --> 00:10:02.519
that interaction between the students 
among themselves